WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.490
1640 and King Charles the first of England and Scotland

00:00:02.490 --> 00:00:04.355
has recalled Parliament

00:00:04.355 --> 00:00:06.295
Why?

00:00:06.295 --> 00:00:07.575
because his rebelling against his relgious reforms

00:00:07.575 --> 00:00:08.075
1640 and King Charles the first of England and Scotland

00:00:08.075 --> 00:00:09.665
and he needed men and money to  fight them

00:00:09.665 --> 00:00:12.295
he was hoping that Parliament would forget

00:00:12.295 --> 00:00:15.015
the previous eleven years in which he had governed without them and simply give him the money

00:00:15.015 --> 00:00:16.375
he was wrong

00:00:16.375 --> 00:00:18.935
instead Parliament wanted to right all of Charles' previous

00:00:18.935 --> 00:00:21.975
wrongs against them and so he dissolved it after only three weeks

00:00:21.975 --> 00:00:24.815
hence its name The Short Parliament

